            "review_text": "GoPlaces19151405415\n1 contribution\n0\nA must-visit for pizza lovers!\nMar 2025 • Solo\nIf you love pizza, this place should be on your list when visiting Hanoi! The wood-fired pizzas have the perfect balance of crunch and chewiness. I had the Brie Cheese Pizza, and it was rich and delicious. The restaurant is easy to find in the Old Quarter, and the staff makes you feel at home. Definitely a must-try\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 11, 2025",
